==Restrictions==
Unit Restriction: Only [[Cat Giraffe Modoki (Special Cat)|Cat Giraffe Modoki]], [[Catnip Tricky (Special Cat)|Catnip Tricky]] and [[Catnip Dragon (Special Cat)|Catnip Dragon]]

==Battleground==
*1 [[White Wind]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*1 [[Red Wind]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*1 [[Dark Wind]] (500%) spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Dark Wind]] (1%) spawns as the boss.
**5 [[White Wind]]s spawn, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
**5 [[Red Wind]]s spawn, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
**5 [[Dark Wind]]s (500%) spawn, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.

==Strategy==
An easy stage. Even with the restriction of only using the [[JRA Collaboration Event|JRA Collaboration]] units, the enemies serve practically no threat at all. Although it is recommended to have them to beat at least at level 1+10 so that they have survivability.

